WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Package the occupants. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Place people, cargo and major systems

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Packaging places occupants, cargo and major systems inside a defined envelope. Styling has to negotiate those hard volumes.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Reserve a seat, pedal box and luggage envelope first; then check whether the desired roof and hood shape still fit.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Packaging puzzle

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Place people, cargo and major systems
